Sure! To fetch those stocks with their respective time frames, let’s break it down into individual requests—one for each company/duration combo. Here’s how we’ll do it:

```json
{
    "name": "get_stock_prices",
    "arguments": {
        "companies": ["Apple"],
        "duration": "1 week"
    }
}
```

Once we receive Apple’s data, we’ll follow up with similar calls for Microsoft (2 weeks), Amazon (3 weeks) and Tesla (1 month). Let me know if this approach works for you!
